 is checked on the server: signed out, these names and details are never sent to the browser. In the story, the parish office opens an account for each member household.</p><p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/account/login?returnUrl=/rota">Member sign-in</a><a class="btn line" href="{{ PathBase }}/members">What members see</a></p></div>{% endif %}</div></section>
